### 消息推送
POST http://localhost:5019/api/Message/publish
Content-Type: application/json
###

### DDD 创建订单
POST http://localhost:5019/api/ddd/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1001,
      "productName": "机械键盘",
      "unitPrice": 299.00,
      "currency": "CNY",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": 1002,
      "productName": "鼠标",
      "unitPrice": 99.00,
      "currency": "CNY",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
### DDD 获取订单详情
GET http://localhost:5019/api/ddd/orders/2
Accept: application/json
###

### DDD 更新订单商品数量
PUT http://localhost:5019/api/ddd/orders/2/items/20988857-5eaa-475e-872e-d0fec7a93707/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}
###

### DDD 取消订单
POST http://localhost:5019/api/ddd/orders/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
###
